==Finnish==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|fi|urj-fin-pro|*elädäk}}, from {{inh|fi|urj-pro|*elä-}}.<ref>{{R:fi:EVE|elää|accessdate=2024-01-01}}</ref> Cognate with {{cog|se|eallit}}, {{cog|myv|эрямс}} and {{cog|hu|él}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{fi-p|*}}

===Verb===
{{fi-verb}}

# {{lb|fi|intransitive}} to [[live]], be [[alive]]
#: {{syn|fi|[[olla]] [[elossa]]}}
#: {{ux|fi|'''Elän''' kuin viimeistä päivää.|I '''live''' as if this were the last day [of my life].}}
# {{lb|fi|intransitive}} to [[live]] {{gl|somewhere}}
#: {{syn|fi|asua}}
#: {{ux|fi|'''Olen elänyt''' koko ikäni tässä kaupungissa.|I '''have lived''' in this town for all my life.}}
# {{lb|fi|transitive}} to [[live]] {{gl|spend as one's life}}
# {{lb|fi|figurative|intransitive}} to [[live]] {{gl|survive, persist; endure in memory}}
# {{lb|fi|figurative|intransitive}} to [[change]], be [[in flux]]
# {{lb|fi|intransitive}} to [[live]] on {{q|+ adessive}}
# {{lb|fi|partitive verb}} to [[breathe]] {{gl|to be very passionate about something}}
#: {{syn|fi|elää ja hengittää}}

